{
 "title": "文本处理：std.string",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "在 Greengold 中文本有两种形式：**`str`**（不可变，是一个视图：`\"hello\"`）和 **`string`**（可在堆上增长的 UTF-8 序列）。`std.string` 提供了对两者都适用的辅助函数。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "import std.string",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    text = \"  apple,pear,banana  \"",
    "    trimmed = string.str_trim(text)",
    "    print(trimmed)",
    "    print(string.str_contains(trimmed, \"pear\"))",
    "    print(string.str_starts_with(trimmed, \"apple\"))",
    "    parts = string.str_split(trimmed, ',')",
    "    print(parts.len)",
    "    for p in parts:",
    "        print(p)"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "apple,pear,banana",
    "true",
    "true",
    "3",
    "apple",
    "pear",
    "banana"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "要构建可增长的 `string`，使用 `string.from`、`append_str` 和 `append_byte`；输出时用 `as_str()` 取得只读视图。数字转换返回 `Optional`：`parse_i64`、`parse_f64`。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "import std.string",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    msg = string.from(\"Greengold\")",
    "    msg.append_str(\" Language\")",
    "    msg.append_byte('!')",
    "    print(msg.as_str())",
    "    print(string.parse_i64(\"42\").value_or(0))",
    "    print(string.parse_i64(\"4x2\").value_or(-1))",
    "    print(string.to_upper(\"hello\").as_str())"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "Greengold Language!",
    "42",
    "-1",
    "HELLO"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "exercise",
   "id": "c10-l02-x1",
   "prompt": "把文本 `\"1,2,3,4\"` 按逗号拆分，用 `parse_i64` 转换每一部分，并输出它们的总和。",
   "starter": [
    "import std.string",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    total: i64 = 0",
    "    print(total)"
   ],
   "solution": [
    "import std.string",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    total: i64 = 0",
    "    parts = string.str_split(\"1,2,3,4\", ',')",
    "    for p in parts:",
    "        total += string.parse_i64(p).value_or(0)",
    "    print(total)"
   ],
   "hint": "用 `str_split` 拆分，在循环里累加 `parse_i64(p).value_or(0)`。",
   "expected": [
    "10"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quiz",
   "id": "c10-l02-q1",
   "q": "`string.parse_i64(\"abc\")` 返回什么？",
   "options": [
    "0",
    "`None`（一个 `Optional`）",
    "程序崩溃"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "why": "无法转换的文本得到 `None`；失败被表达为一个值。"
  }
 ]
}
